1. Fine-Tune Ollama with a Custom Modelfile - Ollama uses a Modelfile to customize models with system prompts and training context — this is your "fine-tuning" for domain restriction.

Create Modelfile:
 
 you will find the modelfile in this folder 

2. Build and run your custom model:
ollama create oilgas-assistant -f Modelfile
ollama run oilgas-assistant
ollama serve

3. Modelfile is not true fine-tuning in the deep learning sense. 
True fine-tuning retrains model weights on the dataset,
which requires GPU resources and training data.

